        "Enter ihram at the miqat with the niyyah of Umrah, perform the full Umrah, then shave or trim and leave ihram. Stay in Makkah until the 8th." to "Ku gal ixraamka Miqaatka adigoo wata niyyah Cumrada, oo dhan Cumrada, kadibna iska xiir ama jar oo ka tag ixraamka. Makkah joog ilaa 8-da.",
        "Follow the Umrah tab step by step." to "Raac tabka cumrada tallaabo-tallaabo.",
        "Keep away from sin; use these days for Tawaf, Quran and dua." to "Dembiga ka fogow; u isticmaal maalmahan Tawaaf, Quraan iyo duco.",
        "Make the niyyah of both Umrah and Hajj together and recite the Talbiyah. This ihram stays on until Halq on the 10th." to "Niyada Cumrada iyo Xajkaba wada dhig oo akhri Talbiyah. ixraamkani waxa uu jirayaa ilaa Halq 10 ka.",
        "Perform the Tawaf and Sa'i of Umrah but do not shave. Then perform Tawaf al-Qudum; you may do the Sa'i of Hajj after it." to "Samee Tawaafka iyo Sacii Cumrada laakiin ha xiirin. Kadibna samee Tawaf al-Qudum; waxaa laga yaabaa inaad gudato Saacid Xajka ka dib.",
        "Stay in ihram and keep reciting the Talbiyah after the Umrah." to "Ixram ku joog oo akhri Talbiyah Cumrada ka dib.",
