        "The arrival Tawaf, Sunnah for pilgrims from outside the miqat. You may do the Sa'i of Hajj after it." to "Imaatinka Tawaaf, Sunnada xujayda ka baxsan miqaatka. Waxa laga yaabaa in aad gudato Sacii Xajka kadib.",
        "If you will do Sa'i after it, men do Raml and Idtiba in this Tawaf." to "Haddaad saci doonto ka dib, nimanku waxay sameeyaan Raml iyo Idtiba Tawafkan.",
        "Put on ihram in Makkah with the niyyah of Hajj, recite the Talbiyah and go to Mina. Pray Dhuhr to the next Fajr there." to "Makkah ku ixraamta niyada xajka, ku akhri Talbiyah oo aad Mina. Ducada Fajarka xiga halkaas ku tuko.",
        "Stay in your ihram and go to Mina with the Talbiyah. Pray Dhuhr to the next Fajr there." to "Ixramkaaga ku joog oo Mina ula tag Talbiyah. Ducada Fajarka xiga halkaas ku tuko.",
        "Staying in Mina on the 8th and the night of the 9th is Sunnah." to "In la joogo Mina 8-da iyo habeenka 9-aad waa sunno.",
        "Recite the Talbiyah often." to "Inta badan akhri Talbiyah.",
        "Being in Arafat for any moment from zawal on the 9th until dawn of the 10th fulfils the fard; staying until sunset is wajib." to "Joogitaanka Carrafo daqiiqad kasta laga bilaabo zawaal 9-ka ilaa waaberiga 10-aad waxay buuxinaysaa faradka; joogista ilaa qorraxdu ka dhacdo waa waajib.",
        "Hanafi: Dhuhr and Asr are combined only behind the Imam of Hajj at Masjid Namirah. In your tent, pray each at its own time." to "Xanafi: Dhuxur iyo Casar waxa la isku daray oo keliya Imaamka Xajka ee Masjid Namirah. teendhadaada dhexdeeda mid kastaaba wakhtigeeda ku tukada.",
        "Stay inside the boundary markers of Arafat." to "Joog gudaha calamadaha soohdinta Carafaat.",
        "Spend the afternoon standing in dua, istighfar and Talbiyah, facing the Qibla." to "Galka bixi adigoo taagan ducada, istighfar iyo Talbiyah, una jeedda Qiblada.",
        "Leaving Arafat before sunset makes a Dam due, unless you return before sunset." to "Ka bixida Carafa ka hor qorrax dhaca waxa ay keenaysaa biyo xidheen, haddii aanad soo noqon ka hor qorrax dhaca.",
        "Leave Arafat after sunset without praying Maghrib. At Muzdalifah pray Maghrib and Isha together in Isha time and spend the night there." to "Carrafo ka bax qorrax dhaca kadib adoon tukan Maghrib. Muzdalifah ku tukada Maghrib iyo Cisha si wada jir ah wakhtiga Cishaha oo ku hoyda.",
        "The wajib wuquf is between dawn and sunrise on the 10th: pray Fajr early and stay in dhikr." to "Waajibku wuxuu u dhexeeyaa waaberiga iyo qorrax ka soo baxa 10-ka: ku tukada Subax goor hore oo joogso.",
        "Pick up chickpea-sized pebbles: 49 in all, or 70 if you will stay for the 13th." to "Soo qaado quruurux cabbirkoodu yahay digirta: 49 guud ahaan, ama 70 haddii aad joogi doonto 13-ka.",
        "The sick, elderly and weak may leave after midnight because of the crowd, with no penalty." to "Kuwa buka, waayeelka iyo kuwa tabarta daran waxa laga yaabaa inay ka baxaan saqda dhexe ka dib dadka badan, iyada oo aan wax ciqaab ah lahayn.",
        "Stone only Jamrat al-Aqabah (the big one) with seven pebbles, one at a time. Stop the Talbiyah with the first pebble." to "Dhagax kaliya Jamratul-Aqabah (kan weyn) oo leh toddobo dhagax, midba mar. Jooji Talbiyah dhagaxa ugu horreeya.",
        "Then offer the Qurbani (Dam-e-Shukr), then shave or trim. Hanafi: this order is wajib; breaking it makes a Dam due." to "Ka dib Qurbani u bixi (Dam-e-Shukr), ka dibna iska xiir ama jar. Xanafi: amarkaan waa waajib; jabintu waxay ka dhigaysaa biyo xidheen.",
        "Then shave or trim. Qurbani is recommended for Ifrad; if you offer it, do so before Halq." to "Kadibna iska xiir ama jar. Qurbaani waxaa lagula talinayaa Ifrad; haddaad bixiso, samee Halq ka hor.",
        "The Sunnah time for this Rami is from sunrise until zawal." to "Waqtiga sunnada ah ee Raamigu waa laga bilaabo qorrax ka soo baxa ilaa zawaal.",
        "After Halq everything forbidden in ihram becomes lawful except marital relations, until Tawaf al-Ziyarah." to "Halq ka bacdi wax kasta oo ixraamka ah waxa ay xalaal noqonayaan marka laga reebo xidhiidhka guurka, ilaa Tawaaf al-Ziyarah.",
        "The obligatory Tawaf of Hajj. Perform it after Halq, best on the 10th, and before sunset on the 12th." to "Tawaafka waajibka ah ee xajka. Samee Halq ka dib, sida ugu fiican 10-ka, iyo ka hor qorrax dhaca 12-ka.",
        "Then perform the Sa'i of Hajj between Safa and Marwah." to "Kadibna ku xaji Saciidada Xajka inta u dhaxaysa Safa iyo Marwah.",
        "Perform the Sa'i of Hajj now if you did not do it after Tawaf al-Qudum." to "Samee Saacid Xajka hadda haddaadan samayn Tawaf al-Qudum ka dib.",
        "Delaying it past the 12th without excuse makes a Dam due. A woman in her period waits until she is pure, with no penalty." to "Dib u dhigista ay dhaaftay 12-kii cudur daar la'aan waxay ka dhigaysaa biyo-xireen. Naagtii caadadu waxay sugtaa ilaa ay daahir ka noqoto, iyadoo aan wax ciqaab ah lahayn.",
        "After this Tawaf, marital relations also become lawful." to "Tawaafka ka dib, xiriirka guurku wuxuu noqdaa mid xalaal ah.",
        "Spend the days in Mina. Each day after zawal stone all three — Ula, Wusta, then Aqabah — with seven pebbles each." to "Ku bixi maalmaha Mina. Maalin kasta zawal ka dib dhammaan saddexdii - Ula, Wusta, ka dibna Aqabah - oo leh toddoba dhagax midkiiba.",
        "After the Ula and the Wusta, step aside, face the Qibla and make a long dua. Do not stop for dua after the Aqabah." to "Ula iyo Wusta ka bacdi, dhinac u leexo, Qibladana wajaho oo duco dheer samee. Ha u istaagin ducada ka dib Aqabaha.",
        "You may leave Mina on the 12th before sunset. If you are still in Mina at dawn on the 13th, the Rami of the 13th becomes wajib." to "Waxaa laga yaabaa inaad ka baxdo Mina 12-aad ka hor qorrax dhaca. Haddii aad weli ku sugan tahay Mina marka waagu beryo ee 13-aad, Ramiga 13-aad wuxuu noqonayaa waajib.",
        "The sick and the weak who cannot reach the Jamarat may appoint someone to stone for them." to "Kuwa buka iyo kuwa taagta daran ee aan Jameecada gaadhi karin ayaa laga yaabaa inay u magacaabaan qof dhagax u dhiga.",
        "Reset the counter each day." to "Dib u deji miiska miiska maalin kasta.",
        "Tawaf al-Wida, wajib for pilgrims from outside the miqat. Make it your last act in Makkah." to "Tawaaf al-Wida, waa waajib xujayda ka baxsan miqaatka. Ka dhig falkii ugu dambeeyay ee Makkah.",
        "No Raml, Idtiba or Sa'i in this Tawaf." to "Tawaafkan Raml, Idtiba iyo Sacii kuma jiro.",
        "A woman in her period is excused from it." to "Naag caada ku jirta waa laga dhaafaa.",
        "Drink Zamzam, make dua at the Multazam and leave with a heart longing to return." to "Cab Zamzam, ku ducayso Multazam oo ka tag adiga oo u hiloobay inuu soo noqdo.",
        "Fard and Wajib" to "Fard iyo Waajib",
        "What makes Hajj and Umrah valid" to "Maxaa Xajka iyo Cumrada ka dhigaya mid ansax ah",
        "Hajj fard: Ihram, Wuquf at Arafat, Tawaf al-Ziyarah. Missing one cannot be made up by Dam." to "Xaaji fard: Ixraam, Wuquuf at Carafaat, Tawaf al-Ziyarah. Mid maqan ma samayn karo Dam.",
        "Hajj wajib: Muzdalifah, Sa'i, Rami, Qurbani for Qiran and Tamattu', Halq or Qasr, Tawaf al-Wida." to "Xajka waajibka ah: Muzdalifah, Saci, Rami, Qurbani for Qiran and Tamattu', Halq or Qasr, Tawaf al-Wida.",
        "Umrah: Ihram is the condition and Tawaf is fard; Sa'i and Halq or Qasr are wajib." to "Cumrada: Ixraamku waa shardi, Tawaafna waa fard; Saci iyo Halq ama Qasri waa waajib.",
        "Missing a wajib without a valid excuse makes a Dam due: one goat or sheep slaughtered within the Haram." to "Waajib la'aan cudur daar la'aanteed waxay keenaysaa biyo-xireen: hal neef oo ari ah ama lax oo lagu gowracay Xaramka dhexdiisa.",
        "Crossing the miqat towards Makkah without ihram makes a Dam due, unless you go back and enter ihram there." to "Miiqaatka oo aad Makka u gudubto iyadoon ixraam la'aana waxay ka dhigaysaa Biyo-xireen, haddaanad dib ugu laaban oo aad ka soo gasho halkaas.",
